        "text": "I don’t think I ever felt love like this, was. Maybe someday we’ll meet again under better circumstances. Love, Lisa “Anomalisa” Hesselman. P.S. I looked up Anomarisa in my Japanese English dictionary. It turns out it means Goddess of Heaven."
